&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor marketplace performance and adjust strategies based on engagement, relevance, merchant outcomes, LTV, and overall health&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain dashboards and reporting to track key Marketplace KPIs and enable data-driven decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Sales, Client Success, and Marketing to grow marketplace partners and increase merchant value&lt;/p&gt;
