&lt;p&gt;Analyze supply-side dynamics, including incentives, pricing, and placement, to understand elasticity and drive incremental GMV&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead analyses and experiments to test and refine new placements and optimize marketplace performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct loan-level profitability analyses to ensure offers align with credit and financial goals while balancing consumer and merchant value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evaluate affiliate portfolio performance by integrating network data, identifying trends, and assessing the incremental impact of merchant-funded incentives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
