&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: experience working with major e-commerce platforms (Shopify, WooCommerce, etc) or exposure to web development concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have : Previous experience in the payments or ecommerce space&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
