&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python, C/C++ or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend experience in WebApps/JavaScript/AngularJS/React&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with object oriented programming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deployment and testing frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
