work with one of Affirm’s most strategic third-party partners to expand the distribution of Affirm’s services to merchants and end users, with the ultimate goal of driving GMV and revenue growth. This is a high-profile, partner-facing role requiring outstanding relationship management and strategic planning skills to influence internal and external stakeholders and create strategic opportunities. As the primary contact for this partner, the Partner Manager will be responsible for spearheading business growth through strategic initiatives that expand Affirm’s reach and create mutual value for both Affirm and the partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Own the relationship with one of Affirm’s largest platform distribution partners and be accountable for the partnership’s growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Build and execute plans to expand into new markets, industries, and product lines while increasing GMV, revenue, users, product adoption, and awareness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Build trusted relationships across the partner organization so Affirm remains top of mind relative to other payment providers. Align incentives and help the partner’s sales teams understand and sell Affirm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Develop a deep understanding of the partner’s business, strategy, and growth plans. Identify where Affirm should build, invest, or work differently to grow alongside the partner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Coordinate teams across Product, Technical, Sales, Customer Success, Credit, Analytics, Marketing, and Risk to deliver partnership initiatives. Handle incoming partner questions and connect them with the right teams to provide timely answers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Create clear ways of working across all teams supporting the partnership, including defined ownership, goals, performance tracking, regular reviews, and action plans. Identify growth opportunities, risks, and process improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Lead quarterly business reviews and executive meetings. Bring together the right data and perspectives to explain performance, focus leaders on the most important issues, and drive clear decisions and follow-up actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;6+ years of experience working directly with B2B clients or partners, ideally in a high-growth technology company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Experience in strategic partnerships, business development, or enterprise account management. Experience in ecommerce, fintech, payments, or consumer financing is preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;A strong track record of building trusted relationships and managing large, complex partner accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Highly organized and able to manage multiple cross-functional projects at once, balance competing priorities, and maintain strong attention to detail.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;An excellent written and verbal communicator, with experience creating clear proposals, memos, and emails and presenting to senior audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to evaluate business performance, identify opportunities and risks, and communicate results clearly to internal and external teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Experience leading complex commercial negotiations and agreements, including competitive bids, renewals, and partnership expansions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Experience creating and maintaining clear processes, program documentation, performance measures, and reporting for complex partnerships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(38, 38, 38) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Proactive and adaptable, with the judgment to take initiative and go beyond defined responsibilities to support the success of the partnership and broader team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base Pay Grade - K&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equity Grade - 6&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employees new to Affirm typically come in at the start of the pay range. Affirm focuses on providing a simple and transparent pay structure which is based on a variety of factors, including location, experience and job-related skills.&lt;br&gt;Base pay is part of a total compensation package that may include equity rewards, monthly stipends for health, wellness and tech spending, and benefits (including 100% subsidized medical coverage, dental and vision for you and your dependents.)&lt;/p&gt;
