e user in every decision.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Consumer Payments team powers how customers successfully make payments to Affirm. As a Senior Product Manager, you will create new payment experiences that make repaying easier, improve payment success, and define how payments are processed safely and cost-effectively. This is a highly cross-functional role that sits at the intersection of Product, Engineering, Analytics, Finance, Design, and Partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
