&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Senior Sales Engineers are part of the Merchant Engineering team and work closely with Affirm’s Sales, Engineering, and Product teams. You will work cross-functionally to develop merchant solutions, serve as a trusted technical advisor to customers, identify product enhancements, and help build internal processes that scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Technical Expertise: Serve as the subject matter expert on Affirm’s integration solutions, demonstrating deep understanding of merchant checkout, customer journeys, and the competitive landscape. Making the most compelling technical case for Affirm to merchants. &lt;em&gt;Consistently demonstrate your technical expertise and knowledge of Affirm’s product suite through developing and articulating compelling technical narratives that map Affirm’s capabilities to merchant systems, increasing solution scope and long-term platform adoption.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Solution Development: Architect elegant solutions addressing specific customer challenges, including complex integrations and customizations. &lt;em&gt;As necessary, think outside-the-box to design and architect end-to-end solutions that address complex merchant challenges, including advanced integrations and customizations. Evaluate tradeoffs across merchant constraints, platform capabilities, and non-functional requirements, and design tailored solutions aligned with each merchant’s business and technical priorities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Merchant Trust: You will be responsible for building the trust of your technical counterparts, both internally and externally, while also fostering long term relationships with our Enterprise &amp;amp; Key merchants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Partner Success: Partner with sales and partner engineering teams to drive opportunities for our largest customers, leading solution strategy and laying groundwork for successful implementations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Product Influence: Act as the &quot;voice of the customer,&quot; providing actionable insights to influence product development and feature prioritization to product management at Affirm.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Knowledge Scaling: Create and share best practices, reusable assets, and training materials to enhance go-to-market efficiency.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Sales Support: Provide technical &amp;amp; architectural input into sales planning and forecasting, identify technical risks and constraints early, and collaborate with Sales Operations to design scalable, repeatable technical engagement models. Work with Sales operations to build and refine scalable business processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Market Engagement: Develop pre-sales support material and documentation for new products and features.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Demo Development: Build and present custom demos as required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;What We Look For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Passion and drive to change consumer checkouts &amp;amp; payments for the better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;BA/BS degree in business/technology, or equivalent technical account management experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;4+ years of experience in 4+ years in Sales Engineering, Solution Architecture, Partner Engineering, Solutions Engineering, technical sales or pre-sales roles, focusing on solution architecture and best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;3+ years of current experience in the payments, fintech, or closely related industry&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong technical acumen in API integrations, SaaS platforms, and enterprise architectures, with particular emphasis on Checkout processes and payment systems&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple assignments simultaneously, work independently and drive projects to completion with minimum guidance and high attention to detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Extensive experience with Ecomm, In-Store, Telesales etc. checkout &amp;amp; payment solutions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Solid understanding of financial infrastructure industry trends and emerging technologies&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Keen technical mind comfortable writing scripts in at least one programming language and also AI tooling/usage familiarity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to articulate complex technical concepts to diverse audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Executive presence and strong relationship-building skills&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Passion for customer success and dedication to championing the customer voice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Experience architecting solutions &amp;amp; technically positioning them with prospects for e-commerce platforms, payment gateways, in-store point of sale systems etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Willingness to travel up to 30% of the time&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;tight&amp;quot;:false},&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null}]&quot;&gt;Base Pay Grade - J&lt;br&gt;Equity Grade - 4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;tight&amp;quot;:false},&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null}]&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Employees new to Affirm typically come in at the start of the pay range. Affirm focuses on providing a simple and transparent pay structure which is based on a variety of factors, including location, experience and job-related skills.&lt;/p&gt;
