&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;tight&amp;quot;:false},&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null}]&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, which includes the annual base pay and the sales incentive target.&lt;/p&gt;
