 implement, and scale advanced ML solutions that drive critical capabilities across the company. You will mentor engineers, bring clarity to complex, ambiguous problems, and contribute to a cohesive long-term ML strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* You will be responsible for setting technical strategy for your team on a year-long time scale, and help your team tie it together with critical, business-impacting projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* You will collaborate with ML Platform, product, engineering, and risk leadership to shape long-term modeling capabilities needed for scalable international expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* You will act as a force-multiplier for your team through your definition and advocacy of technical solutions and operational processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* You will foster a culture of quality and ownership on your team by setting code review and design standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* You will help develop talent on your team by providing feedback and guidance, and leading by example.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* 8+ years of experience researching, designing, deploying, and operating large-scale, real-time machine learning systems. A relevant PhD can count for up to 2 YOE.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* Strong Python skills and experience writing production-quality code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* Experience building and evaluating models for tabular classification problems (including gradient-boosted decision trees like LightGBM/XGBoost, and deep learning frameworks like PyTorch).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* Experience working with distributed data processing or parallel compute frameworks (e.g. Spark, Ray).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* Experience with ML lifecycle tooling for training orchestration, experimentation, and model monitoring (e.g., Kubeflow, Airflow, MLflow).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* Proficient in using AI-powered developer tools (e.g., Claude Code, Codex, Cursor) to accelerate the model development lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* Strong engineering skills and the ability to provide hands-on technical leadership while working with our code and architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* Strong verbal and written communication skills that support effective collaboration with our global engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the people building honest financial products at Affirm should share in its success. That&#39;s why our total rewards are designed to support your health, growth, financial well-being, and future.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In service of our mission, we reward employees through a combination of base pay, equity (from parent company), and comprehensive benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Pay Grade&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;- P&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;365,000 zł&amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp; 485,000 zł&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Base pay ranges and placement within those ranges are determined based on several factors, including role, experience, and job-related skills.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition to base pay, all employees in this role are eligible to receive equity from the parent company each year. This means as Affirm&#39;s parent company grows, employees have the opportunity to share in that growth financially.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affirm Holdings, Inc. Equity Grade example&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity grade: 5&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New hire equity: $48,000-$72,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Refresh: $15,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward equity: $0-$225,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Affirm also provides flexible spending wallets to all employees for technology and wellbeing related needs, which are reimbursable up to 1390 zł per month.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to your compensation, our comprehensive benefits are designed to support you and the people who matter most. Benefits include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Competitive paid time off, paid public holidays, and additional paid Away Days to rest and recharge.&lt;br&gt;• Comprehensive private healthcare through Lux Med&#39;s Platinum package.&lt;br&gt;• A MultiSport card to support your health and well-being.&lt;br&gt;• Learning and development programs to help you grow professionally.&lt;br&gt;• Family healthcare support through Maven and parental leave support through Parentaly.&lt;br&gt;• Mental well-being support through Lyra, including up to 12 confidential counseling or coaching sessions each year for you and your household members.&lt;br&gt;• Financial well-being support through Northstar, with unlimited access to Certified Financial Advisors and planning tools at no cost to you.&lt;br&gt;• Employee Resource Groups (ERGs) that foster connection and inclusion.&lt;br&gt;• Eligibility for creative tax benefits, subject to applicable law, role, and company policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location - Remote Poland&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;The majority of our roles can be located anywhere in Poland.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This job description is not a contractual document, and is not intended to have binding force.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-first with flexibility built in&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Affirm is proud to be a remote-first company. Most roles can be done from almost anywhere within the country of employment. Some positions may occasionally require in-person work at an Affirm office, and a few are office-based due to the nature of the work. All new hires will be invited to attend an in-person onboarding experience.&lt;/p&gt;
