&lt;p&gt;ESP base pay range per year: &lt;strong&gt;€103,000 &amp;nbsp;- &amp;nbsp;€139,000 &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Wallets for tech, food and lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
