&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Ability to read code in at least one major programming language&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the following concepts: integrating UX elements w/ backend services, frameworks, and 3rd party developer APIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, strong project management skills, capable of influencing internal and external stakeholders to stay on schedule&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Passion and drive to change consumer banking for the better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
